<title>ITALY: Alitalia Jan-April loss 80 bln lire vs 320 bln.</title>
<headline>Alitalia Jan-April loss 80 bln lire vs 320 bln.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alitalia managing director Domenico Cempella said on Thursday that the Italian state airline recorded losses of 80 billion lire in the first four months of 1997 against 320 billion losses in the same 1996 period.</p>
<p>Cempella, speaking at a shareholders' meeting, said the group still hoped to close the 1997 year in the black.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom 39 6 678 2501</p>
</text>
